     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap who-ddcc-map-icd11-eudcc-vaccines</b></p><a name=\"who-ddcc-map-icd11-eudcc-vaccines\"> </a><a name=\"hcwho-ddcc-map-icd11-eudcc-vaccines\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <code>http://id.who.int/icd11/mms</code> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-WHODDCCeuur.html\">EUUR codes used in this IG</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Source Concept Details</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Target Concept Details</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> from http://id.who.int/icd11/mms</td><td/><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> from <a href=\"CodeSystem-WHODDCCeuur.html\" title=\"https://ec.europa.eu/health/documents/community-register/html/\">EUUR codes used in this IG</a></td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">XM0GQ8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">EU/1/20/1528</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\"/><td>EU codes are brands and ICD11 is the generic type.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">EU/1/20/1507</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\"/><td>EU codes are brands and ICD11 is the generic type.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">XM9QW8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#nar